<i>Give me the loved one.</i>


00:49:43.649 --> 00:49:44.784
<i>Take what's yours.</i>


00:49:44.786 --> 00:49:46.285
<i>Give me the loved one.</i>


00:49:46.287 --> 00:49:47.355
<i>Take what's yours.</i>


00:49:47.357 --> 00:49:48.557
<i>Give me the loved one.</i>


00:49:48.559 --> 00:49:49.626
<i>Take what's yours.</i>


