everyone you love.</i>


01:06:44.626 --> 01:06:46.027
Roma!


01:06:47.430 --> 01:06:48.497
Roma, hold on!


01:06:48.499 --> 01:06:53.808
Hold on to me!


01:06:53.810 --> 01:06:55.045
Let's go!


01:07:17.457 --> 01:07:18.424
